report Growth "Client Growth"
  by month|year
  date reg_date
  entity simukopa_clients_growth
  role view_reports
  currency KES
  cache 60
  maxrange 1200

  new_clients = count clients "New Clients"
  chg = change(new_clients) "vs Previous"

  forecast new_clients next 7

  headline {label}: {new_clients} new clients[, {updown} {abs(chg)}% on {prev_label}].
  remark new_clients == 0 | watch | No new clients | No clients registered in {label}.
  remark chg !== null && chg <= -25 | watch | Slowing | {label}: {new_clients} new clients, down {abs(chg)}% on {prev_label}.
  remark true | neutral | Registrations | {new_clients} new clients registered in {label}.
